Bloom's universal toast engine (src/toast/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Derived from sonner-native v0.26.4
  https://github.com/gunnartorfis/sonner-native
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Gunnar Torfi Steinarsson

sonner-native is itself a React Native port of sonner
  https://github.com/emilkowalski/sonner
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Emil Kowalski

Bloom vendors the platform-agnostic engine from sonner-native v0.26.4 and
re-implements the presentation layer against Bloom's own theme, icons and
design tokens. No code from sonner's DOM implementation is included; sonner is
credited because sonner-native is a port of it. Each derived module carries a
provenance header naming the upstream file and version it came from.

